{#- The bill builds itself (founder, 2026-11-19): the page's own example, a
    20-person company with one bot at $660 a month, drawn as a bill (founder,
    2026-11-20: the size floor is now 2 people, so the example is smaller). Plays
    once in view (/enterprise/illus.js); still and complete without it. -#}
<figure class="ill ill-bill" data-illus role="img" aria-label="The example bill: 20 people at $8 is $160, one bot is $500, $660 a month.">
  <div class="ill-bill-row">
    <div class="ill-people" data-stagger aria-hidden="true">{% for i in range(20) %}<i></i>{% endfor %}</div>
    <div class="ill-bill-l"><b>20 people</b><span>× $8 a month</span></div>
    <div class="ill-bill-v">$160</div>
  </div>
  <div class="ill-bill-row ill-bill-row--bot">
    <div class="ill-bot" aria-hidden="true">{% include "ill-mark.njk" %}</div>
    <div class="ill-bill-l"><b>1 bot</b><span>× $500 a month</span></div>
    <div class="ill-bill-v">$500</div>
  </div>
  <div class="ill-bill-total"><span>A month</span><b>$660</b></div>
</figure>
